---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FlowDiagram from "../components/FlowDiagram.astro";
import ExperienceJourney from "../components/ExperienceJourney.astro";
---
<Layout title="Ken Lim — Full-Stack Data & AI" description="Ken Lim builds the whole path from raw data to shipped AI products: pipelines and platforms, curation and governance, ML models, and RAG and agent services, observable and cataloged in production. 18+ years across fintech, healthtech, proptech and the public sector.">

  <!-- letterhead / hero -->
  <section class="relative pt-16 pb-12 sm:pt-24">
    <h1 class="whitespace-nowrap font-display font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100" style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,5.6vw,3rem)">
      Full-Stack Data &amp; AI<span class="text-stone-300">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      I build the whole path from raw data to shipped AI products: the pipelines and platforms
      that ingest and move data, the curation and governance that make it trustworthy, the ML
      models trained on it, and the RAG and agent services that turn it into smart automation.
      All of it is observable and cataloged in production.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-[12.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">New York City · 18+ years experience · U.S. citizen</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-start gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[12px]">
      <a class="text-[#03aa5c] hover:underline dark:text-[#3cc287]" href="mailto:mail@kennylim.com">mail@kennylim.com</a>
      <a class="text-stone-500 hover:text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-stone-100" href="tel:+19298889061">+1 (929) 888-9061</a>
      <a class="text-stone-500 hover:text-[#03aa5c] dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-stone-100" href="https://linkedin.com/in/kenny-lim" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 1. about me -->
  <section data-reveal class="border-t border-stone-200/80 py-12 dark:border-stone-800">
    <p class="font-displaymono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-stone-400">01 — who I am</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">About me</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      <p>
        I'm a hands-on data tech lead, and for more than 18 years I've been turning messy,
        complex data into platforms people rely on.
      </p>
      <p>
        It started with a decade of consulting. I built big-data platforms for clients in
        finance, government, healthcare, retail, and utilities around the world. Every
        engagement reinforced the same lessons: be pragmatic, stay results-driven, watch costs
        closely, and say plainly what's working and what isn't.
      </p>
      <p>
        Since then, I've built data and AI platforms across fintech, healthtech, consumer and
        enterprise SaaS, proptech, and the public sector. I was part of three acquisitions
        along the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today my work covers the full arc. I set the data strategy, design the architecture,
        write the production code, and run the platforms at scale. I also build and grow
        high-performing data teams, and I've led onshore and offshore consultants working
        alongside them.
      </p>
      <p>
        One thing hasn't changed: I still do the elbow-grease work. I eat my own dog food. I
        write the code, take it to production, and keep running it myself — monitoring,
        scaling, tuning — as it grows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. what I do -->
  <section id="do" data-reveal class="scroll-mt-6 border-t border-stone-200/80 py-12 dark:border-stone-800">
    <p class="font-displaymono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-stone-400">02 — the work</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">What I do</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">
      The five stages below — what each one produces.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9">
      <FlowDiagram />
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
      Where I've done it → <a class="text-[#03aa5c] hover:underline dark:text-[#3cc287]" href="/experience">Experience</a>
    </p>
  </section>

</Layout>
